{"title":"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/9/dd92e38ce08be70d3aebaaa547e34aed455668fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + q + r = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/3/3f3b8fd17e62dd7b94077e738dc00380d87b27da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + r = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"17\" />, then the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/a/71a1d4748903ba883bc5d50d74243d0239b375e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 11 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 12 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 13 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/9/dd92e38ce08be70d3aebaaa547e34aed455668fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + q + r = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"17\" /> can be arranged into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f532f3fb340634557ec8f18138084421c8fc6d07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + r + q = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"17\" /> due to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Commutative_property\" title=\"Commutative property\">commutative property</a> of addition. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/3/3f3b8fd17e62dd7b94077e738dc00380d87b27da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + r = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"17\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/632149e19cddf227b58b551f52bfd119806d720d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 + q = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97780de15462e8a71d67a2acb5c7b9d34e9b89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = 19 - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/8/778aa1540591cc1d3156231cbfb365d838e247a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"99\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwa